# Nothing is vendored here any more. three.js was only ever pulled in to draw the
# kart marker that travelled the lap; the marker is gone and the 1.4 MB went with
# it, along with kart.js.
#
# It is worth remembering why this file used to matter: `vendor/` was ignored
# wholesale, so three.module.js existed on one machine and 404'd on the deployed
# site, and because kart.js imported it at module load that failure took the
# whole of trackmap.js down — no markers, no pan, no zoom, just a photograph.
